        "summary": "Compound 1 shows weak dominant antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd coupling and a large magnetocaloric effect. Room-temperature χmT is close to 18 isolated Gd3+ ions; χmT decreases on cooling. PHI fitting of a three-J Hamiltonian plus zJ gave mixed AF/FM couplings with g = 1.98. Magnetization at 2 K/50 kOe approaches but does not fully reach the 18 Gd3+ saturation value. The experimental maximum -ΔSm is 25.9 J kg-1 K-1 (ΔH = 50 kOe, 2.0 K), below the uncoupled theoretical 36.4 J kg-1 K-1.",
